From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] libs/vkd3d: upstream vkd3d 2.1 (was 1.14): HLSL geometry shaders, RetroArch's first start

The vkd3d bundled in libs/vkd3d (Direct3D 12 on Vulkan and the HLSL compiler behind d3dcompiler) is upstream vkd3d 2.1, imported as Wine imports it. Its HLSL compiler parses and compiles geometry shaders, which 1.14 did not: RetroArch's first start used its Direct3D 11 driver, whose menu sprite shader is one, and exited.
---
diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/config.h b/libs/vkd3d/config.h
index 6eb38f8..586d774 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d/config.h
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/config.h
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 #define PACKAGE_NAME "vkd3d"
-#define PACKAGE_STRING "vkd3d 1.14"
-#define PACKAGE_VERSION "1.14"
+#define PACKAGE_STRING "vkd3d 2.1"
+#define PACKAGE_VERSION "2.1"
 #define PATH_MAX 1024
 #define SONAME_LIBVULKAN "vulkan-1.dll"
